  "description": "Maui.Shell.MarkerModifier provides modern XAML Attached Properties for customizing Shell menu and navigation selection markers in .NET MAUI. Easily style marker color, dimensions, corner radius, margin, and visibility with full Hot Reload support.",
  "iconFile": "iconapp.png",
