  "readmeFile": "Readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.3.0:\n- Added modern, clean ShellMarker XAML Attached Properties API (Color, Width, Height, CornerRadius, Margin, IsVisible).\n- Fixed WinUI 3 resource type handling by using SolidColorBrush for NavigationViewSelectionIndicatorForeground.\n- Added support for system theme switching (Light/Dark) without marker color resets.\n- Fixed static initialization null-reference risks and removed crash hazards on null bindings.\n- Added platform architecture support for Android, iOS, and MacCatalyst.\n- Full backwards compatibility with version 10.2.0 MarkerWindowsExtensions.",
